        "text": "According to Eric J. Feigin, the dispute concerns whether a district judge may revoke supervised release under 18\u202fU.S.C.\u202f\u00a7\u202f3583(e)(3) based on a finding of child pornography possession by a preponderance of the evidence."
      },
